d["objectives"]=["Derive the equation of a circle given its center and radius.","Complete the square to find the center and radius of a circle.","Determine the relative positions of a circle and a line in the plane.","Solve a system of equations with one linear equation and one equation of a circle algebraically and verify the solution by graphing."]
